---
import DemoFrame from './DemoFrame.astro';
import GoErrorChainDemo from '../demos/GoErrorChainDemo.tsx';
---
<figure class="gec-figure">
  <DemoFrame title="Unwrap an error chain one layer at a time" titleVi="Bóc chuỗi lỗi từng tầng một">
    <GoErrorChainDemo client:visible />
  </DemoFrame>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Both chains come from a real Go 1.27.1 run. With %v the message text is identical, but the link to the original error is gone, so errors.Is returns false.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Cả hai chuỗi lấy từ một lần chạy thật trên Go 1.27.1. Với %v, nội dung thông báo y hệt, nhưng đường nối tới lỗi gốc đã mất, nên errors.Is trả về false.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style is:global>
  .gec-figure { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .gec-figure > .demo-frame { margin-bottom: 0; }
  .gec-figure > figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
  .gec .sd-group > span, .gec .sd-stat span { text-transform: none; letter-spacing: 0; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; }
  .gec-chain { list-style: none; margin: 0 0 12px; padding: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; }
  .gec-layer { position: relative; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; padding: 10px 12px; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 8px; background: var(--bg); }
  .gec-layer.is-current { border-color: var(--gold); background: var(--gold-tint-bg); }
  .gec-layer.is-peeled { opacity: 0.45; }
  .gec-layer.is-cut { border-style: dashed; opacity: 0.55; }
  .gec-code { font-family: var(--font-mono, ui-monospace, monospace); font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-body); overflow-wrap: anywhere; background: none; padding: 0; }
  .gec-text { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--text); overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
  .gec-link { font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-muted); font-family: var(--font-mono, ui-monospace, monospace); }
  .gec-now { overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
  .gec-yes { color: var(--text); }
  .gec-no { color: var(--red); }
</style>
